⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Political Caste
node JTI · JTI · ⟦The Political Caste:JTI:8373f4⟧

WHO   — The Political Caste — caste as vote-bank & identity
WHAT  — The reason caste stays salient even as belief fades: reservations and elections make caste a permanent political resource. Identity that is administratively useful does not disappear — it gets organized, counted, and courted.
WHERE — JTI · the caste system  Framework inputs: the Rigveda, Manusmriti, Dumont, ancient-DNA genetics, Dirks, the Constitution, Pew/IHDS, Ambedkar  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the final answer to 'why is it still a thing' is partly that caste is now POLITICALLY useful — a coalition, a quota, a constituency.
HOW   — By electoral mobilization, caste-based parties, and the demand for (and against) caste enumeration.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  Belief in the hymn can die and I will not — because I am no longer a prayer, I am a constituency, and a constituency is never voted out of existence.

